# ISCC 2021 reproducibility snapshot
Copyright 2021 Luis Augusto Dias Knob, Carlos Henrique Kayser, Tiago Ferreto

This repository contains the paper-era ContainerSim simulator and the archived
result files used for the ISCC 2021 paper "Improving Container Deployment in
Edge Computing Using the Infrastructure Aware Scheduling Algorithm."

The simulation code is derived from ContainerSim. See ERRATA.md for the
compatibility fixes and the scenario weights used in the runnable release.
